{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And this is the blessing with which Moses blessed.</b> When the blessed El showed him all the land before his death, so that he might bless the land and Israel in it — as was his intent in saying ״אֶעְבְּרָה נָּא וְאֶרְאֶה״ (Deuteronomy 3:25). And so too was the intent of the blessed El when He said to him ״וּרְאֵה אֶת הָאָרֶץ״ (Numbers 27:12). This is that blessing."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:27.855102397Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}